```
lib/tools.ts          ← pure JS functions: readDomainScores, listSeenCombinations, validateScenario
lib/llm.ts            ← add callLLMWithTools(systemPrompt, messages, tools, opts)
agents/orchestrator.ts ← runs the tool-call loop, feeds results back
```

The model decides what to call and when — that's the agentic property. The developer defines what's available. Three rounds max = 4 API calls for scenarioAgent worst case, well within free tier.

